.TH "SCCFM-CLI TRANSACTION" "1" "2026-08-24" "0.39.5" "sccfm-cli transaction Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-transaction \- Check transaction status by UID.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli transaction
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check transaction status by UID.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t,\fP \-\-transaction\-uid TEXT
Transaction UID to inspect.  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\fP / \-\-no\-wait
Wait for the transaction to finish before returning.  [default: no-wait]
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fP INTEGER RANGE
Maximum seconds to wait for the transaction to complete (used with --wait).  [default: 3600; x>=1]
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fP [table|json]
Output format  [default: table]
.TP
\fB\-\-config\-path\fP PATH
Path to the configuration file (defaults to ~/.sccfm-cli/config.json).
